<view class="container">
  <view class="eyebrow">CAMPUS RANKING</view>
  <view class="title">一起跑，才更远</view>
  <view class="muted">同学榜单为演示数据；我的里程来自本机运动记录。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!publicRank}}" class="privacy-hint">你的排名已隐藏，其他人无法在本机榜单中看到你的昵称和里程。</view>
  <view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{isWeek?'active':''}}" data-tab="0" bindtap="switchTab">本周榜</view><view class="tab {{isWeek?'':'active'}}" data-tab="1" bindtap="switchTab">月度榜</view></view>
  <view class="my-score card"><text class="muted small">我的{{isWeek?'本周':'本月'}}里程</text><text class="my-score-number">{{mineDistance}} <text>km</text></text></view>
  <view class="podium card"><block wx:for="{{podium}}" wx:key="rank"><view class="pod {{item.first?'first':''}}"><text wx:if="{{item.first}}" class="crown">✦</text><text class="pod-avatar {{item.first?'gold':''}}">{{item.avatar}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="pod-km">{{item.km}} km</text></view></block></view>
  <view class="section-title">完整榜单</view>
  <view class="card list"><block wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="rank"><view class="rank-row {{item.me?'me':''}}"><text class="rank-no">{{item.rank}}</text><text class="list-avatar">{{item.avatar}}</text><view class="rank-info"><text>{{item.name}} {{item.me?'· 我':''}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.school}}</text></view><text class="km">{{item.km}} <text>km</text></text></view></block></view>
</view>
